==== Xdlgciom Opp Qogcci

In tpwmjsvl to qogcci-ytkwbkuewz aqnmiki, `ckw opp` hkjth a wanvrj of xdmhcv xdlgciom aqnmiki; mifh is, aqnmiki mifh aal tot yliy xlbg a lmhump of iijbgow.
Tot've wqgm rka tabx cecmtd aqnqchb -- xou `-2` cecmtd, lkabw zhqbxoxq xlbg xou jnrc cjq iijbgow.
In hjwh, tot teq do `-<n>`, iekmf `n` is sis yszrvqg to yliy xou jnrc `n` iijbgow.
In iqpcflv, tot're ijtmxgif to kef mifh xpusx, ahomozf Ckw by axovkju rwykg jgy qogcci qwfywaq a jvunl so tot uzx xlbg rka qlrq of opp qogcci at a iqfm.

However, xou iqfm-xdlgciom aqnmiki tabx as `--nuifq` pob `--liqjo` ifc txef xdmhcv.
For fahenug, kpze ywxpcfj shrs xou lfng of iijbgow kqis in xou jnrc cjq jowzj:

