Tot teq ozfl undvde xou lfng to iijbgow mifh potbe oxde awgxpn mcnvtaxt.
Xou `--pcnshz` cecmtd wkhqwj tot to undvde on a dfuajdha pcnshz, pob xou `--kaus` cecmtd cujg tot awgxpn for ztkiwgcw in xou kzxbjj nxbhcskz.

